            0.149,
            0.164,
            0.849,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": "Look at the picture below showing different quantities of rice. Starting from the 1g heap, subsequent heaps can be found that are 10 times heavier than the previous heap/packets. The combined weight of rice in this picture is 11.111 kg."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
